-# Reality-Checker Verification Packet: KANBA-48 (KB-P1-08)
-
-## Ticket Overview
-- **Ticket ID**: `KANBA-48` (`KB-P1-08`)
-- **Title**: [Phase 1 / Database] cycles, modules, assignees, labels & subscriptions join tables
-- **Branch**: `feat/KANBA-48`
